OL,3,GNEWSAProtests and profits: 25 years of
OL,4,AManchester's second runway
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen Manchester Airport was given
OL,7,Fpermission to build a second runway in
OL,8,F1997 it prompted one of the country's
OL,9,Fmost high-profile environmental
OL,10,Fprotests of the time.
OL,12,FActivists from across the country set
OL,13,Fup camp, built tree houses and a
OL,14,Fcomplex network of tunnels in a bid to
OL,15,Fstop the bulldozers, but after a stand
OL,16,Foff lasting months they were ultimately
OL,17,Fevicted and the runway was built.
OL,19,FIt became operational in 2001 and
OL,20,Fbecame the only airport outside of
OL,21,FLondon with two full length runways.
OL,23,APub: 22-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
